Dialogue: 8,0:22:04.22,0:22:06.93,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,怖い　怖い　怖い
Dialogue: 9,0:22:06.93,0:22:08.47,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,好可怕…  好可怕…
Dialogue: 8,0:22:06.93,0:22:08.47,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,怖い… 怖い…
Dialogue: 9,0:22:08.47,0:22:09.77,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,好可怕啊
Dialogue: 8,0:22:08.47,0:22:09.77,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,怖いよ
Dialogue: 9,0:22:09.77,0:22:11.39,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,好可怕  好可怕
Dialogue: 8,0:22:09.77,0:22:11.39,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,怖い　怖い
Dialogue: 9,0:22:11.39,0:22:13.48,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,谁来救救我
Dialogue: 8,0:22:11.39,0:22:13.48,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,だれか　助けて
Dialogue: 9,0:23:58.50,0:23:59.54,Text - CN,,0,0,0,/,糟透了…
Dialogue: 8,0:23:58.50,0:23:59.54,Text - JP,,0,0,0,/,最悪…
