Dialogue: 8,0:28:19.51,0:28:20.18,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖いの…
Dialogue: 9,0:28:21.97,0:28:26.35,Text - CN,,0,0,0,,好可怕啊…  好可怕啊…
Dialogue: 8,0:28:21.97,0:28:26.35,Text - JP,,0,0,0,,怖いよ… 怖いよ…
